        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the driver’s seat of a massive semi-truck and take on the ultimate test of precision driving. <i>Rookie to Master Driver</i> is a skill-based parking simulator where every turn, every reverse, and every inch matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in the training yard, learning the basics of trailer control, tight turns, and S-curves. Progress through increasingly demanding challenges — from narrow warehouses and busy ports to winding countryside roads. Each level is carefully designed to push your technique to the limit, rewarding patience, accuracy, and determination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not an open-world trucking game. Instead, it’s a focused journey from rookie to master, built around handcrafted scenarios that highlight the thrill and frustration of maneuvering a giant machine through spaces that barely fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the discipline to control twenty meters of steel, or will you jackknife under pressure? Every mistake is a lesson. Every success brings you closer to mastery.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the driver’s seat of a massive semi-truck and take on the ultimate test of precision driving. <i>Rookie to Master Driver</i> is a skill-based parking simulator where every turn, every reverse, and every inch matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in the training yard, learning the basics of trailer control, tight turns, and S-curves. Progress through increasingly demanding challenges — from narrow warehouses and busy ports to winding countryside roads. Each level is carefully designed to push your technique to the limit, rewarding patience, accuracy, and determination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not an open-world trucking game. Instead, it’s a focused journey from rookie to master, built around handcrafted scenarios that highlight the thrill and frustration of maneuvering a giant machine through spaces that barely fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the discipline to control twenty meters of steel, or will you jackknife under pressure? Every mistake is a lesson. Every success brings you closer to mastery.</p>",
